Cygnet 2026.05.12 data
----------------------
Cygnet is produced by the Open Multilingual Wordnet project and combines data
from independently licensed wordnets. There is no single license for the
aggregate lexical data. Preserve the resource-level attribution and license
information supplied by Cygnet when redistributing the database.
Source: https://github.com/omwn/cygnet/releases/tag/2026.05.12
Software license: MIT
Aggregate data license: LicenseRef-Cygnet-Aggregate
Resource provenance and licenses: https://github.com/omwn/cygnet
Citation: Rowan Hall Maudslay and Francis Bond (2026), "Cygnet: Refactoring the
Open Multilingual Wordnet," LREC 2026.

